{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"12683","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12683","key":"MC-170863","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"05/Feb/20 10:34 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When a creative mode player is in any creative tab other than <tt>Survival Inventory</tt>, and drops an entire item stack from their hotbar all at once (using either <tt>ctrl + q</tt> for &gt;=1 stack items, or <tt>q</tt> for single stack items), the items will be entirely deleted (not just invisible).</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a>Steps to Reproduce:</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>In creative mode, open your inventory</li>\n\t<li>Go to any tab other than <tt>Survival Inventory</tt><br>\n(note: <tt>Search Items</tt> will not work because of the search bar)</li>\n\t<li>Do one of the following:\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>Grab a singular item, and drop it from your hotbar using <tt>q</tt></li>\n\t\t<li>Grab a multi-stack item, and drop it from your hotbar using <tt>ctrl + q</tt></li>\n\t</ol>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a>Observed Behavior:</h3>\n<p>The hand animation plays, but the item is deleted entirely.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedResult%3A\"></a>Expected Result:</h3>\n<p>The item would drop, just like it does when dropped from the <tt>Survival Inventory</tt> tab.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Screenshots%2FVideos%3A\"></a>Screenshots/Videos:</h3>\n<p> <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/16823\" title=\"DropItem.mp4 attached to MC-170863\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"DropItem.mp4\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"23dcdbe9-80ef-483a-a77e-aea38d4a101f\" rel=\"noreferrer\">DropItem.mp4<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> </p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"OldDescription%3A\"></a>Old Description:</h3>\n<blockquote><p><b>The bug</b><br>\nDropping a single item stack from the Creative hotbar by hovering over the item stack in any Creative menu other than the \"Surival Inventory\" one and pressing the drop key (<tt>Q</tt>) only deletes the item stack, but does not drop it.</p>\n\n<p>This is closely related to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-23039\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-23039\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Dropped item disappear in Creative\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-23039\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n where no item would drop regardless of the stack size.<br>\nBut it is <b>not</b> related to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-116618\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-116618\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Dropping items rapidly inside the &quot;Survival Inventory&quot; tab in creative mode deletes items\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-116618\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n since that happens for any stack sizes and the cause for it is understood and described in that report.</p>\n\n<p>Video: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/f4ccl-qkLJI\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://youtu.be/f4ccl-qkLJI</a></p>\n\n<p><b>How to reproduce</b></p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Put any single item in your Creative hotbar</li>\n\t<li>Open any inventory tab except \"Search Items\" and \"Survival Inventory\"</li>\n\t<li>Hover over the item in the hotbar and press <tt>Q</tt> (drop item key)<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The item is deleted</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"05/Feb/20 11:30 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/16823","id":"16823","filename":"DropItem.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] Jingy","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Chicago","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"14/May/24 4:42 PM","size":"1016 kB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/16823"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"15/Aug/24 2:53 PM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"27/Aug/26 1:56 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Dropping item stacks from the player's hotbar in any creative inventory tab other than \"Survival Inventory\" deletes items","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlas